    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are starting your first day at a local garage 'Trish's Pit's. Breaking down engines with nothing but your toolbox. But three stunning mechanics are going to distract you at every nut.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428700/extras/8a5f26a15dc5acbcdf806337d0371bfc.avif?t=1753600515\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428700/extras/58bbfe1ab8cc7eab49bd9ac94ea2ae84.avif?t=1753600515\" /></div><strong>Meet Trish the busty hardworking mechanic, Silvie the Kart racing powerhouse and Frankie the computer nerd. These three girls will be your guide to getting a big nut bank.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Under the Hood takes classic arcade action and mixes it with sexy gameplay, steamy dialouge and a slick soundtrack to create a chill fun game! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1428700/extras/fa277ffcb5f68ad90a3225b54553f4dc.avif?t=1753600515\" /></div><strong>-Over 30 levels of block busting gameplay!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>-New Mechanics keep you on your toes with Springs, Belts and Hazards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>-Explore Silvie, Trish &amp; Frankie before the events of Shady Lewd Kart!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>-Over 12 CG Unlocks to get dirty over!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>-Easy &amp; Normal mode for casual and hardcore gamers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>-Unlockable Challenge mode (Lost levels with even MORE lewd unlocks!)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>-Old school cheats that you can earn to turn